{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "b4e7c2a9-1d58-4f03-9c6e-7a2b8d4e5f10",
        "name": "AQDI Units API",
        "description": "وحدات العقار — API V2 only (`POST \/api\/v2\/unit\/create` creates **one or more** units).\n\n**Base:** `{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v2`  \n**Auth:** Bearer `{{token}}`  \n**Parent property:** set `real_estate_id` first (property must belong to the logged-in user).\n\n### Quick start\n1. Set `baseUrl` (e.g. `http:\/\/localhost:8000`)\n2. Run **0. Auth → Login**\n3. Run **1. Lookups** and copy `unit_type_id` \/ `unit_usage_id`\n4. Set `real_estate_id`\n5. Run **2. Create → Create One Unit** or **Create Multiple Units**\n\n### Form → body\n| UI | Field |\n|---|---|\n| سكني \/ تجاري | `contract_type`: `housing` \/ `commercial` |\n| نوع الوحدة | `unit_type_id` |\n| استخدام الوحدة | `unit_usage_id` |\n| رقم طابق الوحدة | `floor_number` |\n| رقم الوحدة | `unit_number` |\n| مساحة الوحدة | `unit_area` |\n| عدد الغرف | `tootal_rooms` |\n| عدد دورات المياه | `The_number_of_toilets` |\n| عدد المطابخ | `The_number_of_kitchens` |\n| مكيف سبليت | `split_ac` |\n| مكيف شباك | `window_ac` |\n| خزائن المطبخ | `kitchen_tank` or `kitchen_cabinets` |\n| مؤثثة | `furnished` |\n| عداد كهرباء | `electricity_meter` |\n| عداد مياه | `water_meter` |\n\nGenerated by `php tools\/generate_units_postman_collection.php`",
        "schema": "https:\/\/schema.getpostman.com\/json\/collection\/v2.1.0\/collection.json",
        "_exporter_id": "aqdi-blade"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "0. Auth",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Login",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application\/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application\/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v2\/auth\/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v2",
                                "auth",
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"mobile\": \"0512345678\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "description": "Saves `token`. Run this first."
                    },
                    "response": [],
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text\/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const json = pm.response.json();",
                                    "const token = json?.data?.token || json?.token;",
                                    "if (token) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", token); }"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "description": "Bearer token for the rest of the collection."
        },
